<title>DENMARK: Danish September unemployment falls to 8.4 pct.</title>
<headline>Danish September unemployment falls to 8.4 pct.</headline>
<dateline>COPENHAGEN 1996-10-31</dateline>
<text>
<p>Denmark's seasonally adjusted unemployment was 8.4 percent of the workforce in September, down from a revised 8.8 percent in August, the National Statistics Office said on Thursday.  </p>
<p>				Sept 1996    Aug 1996   Sept 1995</p>
<p>    Unemployment rate	8.4 pct    8.8 pct     9.9 pct</p>
<p>    Total unemployed	 234,700    245,700     277,800</p>
<p>All above figures seasonally adjusted.</p>
<p>NOTE - A panel of economists polled by Reuters had on average forecast September unemployment of 8.7 percent.</p>
<p>--Chris Follett, Copenhagen newsroom, 45-33-969650.</p>
</text>
